  "material": true,
  "note": "Bodycam clip and 'Tyler certainly refers to it as his car, not his vehicle' are in the 04:04 block (HappyScribe; corrected transcript est. ~04:13-04:32); range 02:45-03:25 starts ~80s early. 'his car' is the host's characterisation; clip says mom will 'shuttle over from where she's at to her car'.",
  "fix": {
   "timestamp": "00:04:00",
   "claim": "The host says Tyler Robinson refers to it as his car, not his vehicle, in the 2022 police bodycam footage she plays, in which his mother is said to have to \"shuttle over from where she's at to her car\", which she contrasts with the vocabulary of the federal text messages."
  }
 },
